                "markdown": "Add a handler for the event, or, if it is consumed elsewhere, such as by another process, remove it from events.inProcess in domain.config.ts. Accept the finding into the baseline only while it is a known gap you mean to close.\\n\\n[Rule reference](https://github.com/mannkostir/domain-integrity#unhandled-event)"
